.TH geectl-remote-diff-packages 1  "geectl-remote-diff-packages 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-diff\-packages \- Diff two packages, file by file. Computed client\-side: the library diffs the two file lists and cats each changed file, so a differing binary file fails the call
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote diff\-packages\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIOLD_PROJECT\fR> <\fIOLD_PACKAGE\fR> <\fINEW_PROJECT\fR> <\fINEW_PACKAGE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Diff two packages, file by file. Computed client\-side: the library diffs the two file lists and cats each changed file, so a differing binary file fails the call
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIOLD_PROJECT\fR>
The old project
.TP
<\fIOLD_PACKAGE\fR>
The old package
.TP
<\fINEW_PROJECT\fR>
The new project
.TP
<\fINEW_PACKAGE\fR>
The new package
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
